# =============================================================================

# Auxiliares de pdflatex / latexmk / biber
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc

# PDF compilado (regenerable desde el fuente .tex)
*.pdf
